<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise 2.1 bln markka in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise 2.1 bln markka in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to June 6 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to May 30.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 60,566	58,468</p>
<p> Money market intervention     8,154	12,568</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,908	 1,908</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 1,909	 1,909</p>
<p> Other				 7,765	 6,644</p>
<p> Total assets		     80,302	81,497</p>
<p>In the previous week, to May 30, reserves remained largely unchanged (fell one million to 58,468 million).</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
